      "> Subtract 5: −5x > 2",
      ">",
      "> Divide by −5 **and reverse the sign**:",
      ">",
      "> x < **−2/5**",
      ">",
      "> Check with x = −1: 5 − 5(−1) = 5 + 5 = 10, and 10 > 7 ✓",
