      "> 3x + 12 ≥ −4",
      ">",
      "> Subtract 12: 3x ≥ −16",
      ">",
      "> Divide by 3: x ≥ **−16/3**, that is x ≥ −5⅓",
      ">",
      "> Verify with x = 0: ½(0) + 2 = 2, and 2 ≥ −⅔ ✓",
      "",
