      "6.Surface area is measured in… A. linear units B. square units C. cubic units D. degrees **[K]** 7.The surface area of a cuboid 8 cm by 5 cm by 3 cm is… A. 79 cm² B. 120 cm² C. 158 cm² D. 316 cm² **[A]**",
